<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63887" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοπάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flat
				dish</i> or <i>plate</i>, in which food was served, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1034
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>V.</u>
				511
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Sam.</u>
				150
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.142
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>dish</i> in sense of food-preparation, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.653
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>frying-pan</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				109
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arched.
				2.4
			</span></i>; distd. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τήγανον</span> by
			Eub.l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				173.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in Com.
			also, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σορός</span>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Theopomp.Com.
				92
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>a disease of the olive</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.14.3
			</span></i>; <i>rotting at the root</i>, of fig-trees, ib.<i><span class="en">
				5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>shell-fish</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Asin.</u>
				47
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄστρεα καὶ λοπάδας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					4.670
				</span></i>
			; 
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπάς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.6.7
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
